  "body": "Your dream home awaits you and is now selling below CV expectations - we are waiting for your offers.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a highly sought-after park-front setting overlooking Rogers Park, this beautifully crafted near-new residence (approximately 6 years old) delivers an exceptional standard of modern living, combining scale, comfort, and refined design.\r\n\r\nConstructed with quality weatherboard and meticulously maintained, with recently refreshed exterior finishes, this home also offers added peace of mind with the benefit of a Master Build Guarantee still in place. It sits proudly on a flat and private 409 square metre (approximately) site at the end of a quiet driveway, offering both privacy and generous off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed for families of all sizes, this stunning home features 5 spacious bedrooms in total (three master bedrooms with ensuites and two double bedrooms).  \r\n\r\nThese are complemented by multiple living zones across both levels.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stunning designer kitchen with premium appliances and gas cooking, seamlessly connecting to the open-plan dining and main living area.\r\n\r\nLarge sliding doors create effortless indoor-outdoor flow to a sun-soaked and partially covered entertaining area, perfect for year-round gatherings, complemented by a relaxing family spa for ultimate comfort. \r\n\r\nThe well-positioned ground-floor master suite also enjoys direct outdoor access, creating a private retreat for extended family or guests.\r\n\r\nUpstairs offers an equally impressive layout, with the two generously sized master suites on this level capturing tranquil park views, alongside two additional bedrooms serviced by a stylish family bathroom. \r\n\r\nTwo of the master suites have walk-in-robes and there are fully fitted wardrobe systems in the other bedrooms.\r\n\r\nA separate family lounge provides additional space for relaxation, while excellent storage throughout enhances everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include central ducted air conditioning/heating, a separate laundry, double internal access garage, and ample space for two extra vehicles or a boat.\r\n\r\nLocated within top-tier school zones including Bucklands Beach Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College, and just a short stroll to the stunning coastline of Eastern Beach, this home offers a lifestyle second to none.\r\n\r\nCafes, restaurants, Half Moon Bay Marina, golf courses and recreational facilities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThe current owners are relocating and, while this home has been truly cherished, it is now seriously for sale.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this - a near-new, high-spec home in such a tightly held park-front and beach location - are rarely available.\r\n\r\nDon't wait for the next open home - by then, it may be gone.",
